OL,3,GNEWSACity centre festival cut short by
OL,4,Aweather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second day of a city centre
OL,7,Ffestival has been called off because of
OL,8,Fbad weather.
OL,10,FThe Big Feast in Hanley is a free
OL,11,Ftwo-day event which began on Friday,
OL,12,Fbut Stoke-on-Trent City Council said
OL,13,FSaturday's Big Feast programme would
OL,14,Fnot go ahead, with the exception of
OL,15,FTender Exchange at the Potteries
OL,16,FCentre.
OL,18,FThe council said an "enormous amount of
OL,19,Fwork, care and creativity" had gone
OL,20,Finto the planning of the event, and it
OL,21,Fwas "gutted" to cut it short.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
